{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54195","headline":"识黄芽歌 · 还阳子","name":"识黄芽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤感合始成形，造化元居北户生。\n日月循环魂魄满，阴阳交媾龙虎成。\n分明本自从金长，谁悟偏能与水幷。\n无限徧於尘世里，时人日用不知名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"还阳子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}